9.66 9.37950..................... 11.23 9.79 9.48970........... 11.33 9.89 9.581 ,0 0 0................. 11.48 10.05 9.731 ,020................... 11.60 10.15 9.821 )0 5 0.................. 11.82 10.33 9.981 ,080.................. 11.94 10.41 10.06ljllO.............;... 12.15 10.59 10.24l',1 4 0.................. 12.26 10.67 10.33\ni;i70................... 12.46 10.84 10.521 * 2 0 0 ...................12.57 10.92 1 0 .611 ,260............... 12.88 11.20 10.86l|290................. 13.08 11.38 1 1 ..0 21 ,3 2 0................... 13.18 11.47 11.11\nS c h e d u l e A — Ra t e p e e 1 0 0  P o u n d s— Con.\nM il e s\n1,999 \np o u n d s  \no r less\n2,000 \np o u n d s  \nt o  3,999 \n‘ p o u n d s\n4,000 \np o u n d s  \nt o  7,000 \np o u n d s\n1,250 $1 3.3 9 $11,66 $1 1.3 0\n1,380 ..................................... 1 3 .4 9 1 1 .7 5 1 1.39\n1,410 ..................................... 1 3 .6 8 11 .9 5 - 1 1 .5 8\n1,440 ..................................... 1 3 .7 6 1 2 .0 5 1 1 .6 6\n1*470 ..................................... 1 3 .9 2 1 2.26 1 1 .8 2\n1 ,500..................................... 1 4 .0 0 1 2 .3 6 11.91\ni;.53rt . _ 1 4.20 12. 55 1 2 .0 6\n1,560 ..................................... 14.31 1 2.64 1 2 .1 4\n1/500..................................... 14. 51 1 2 .8 2 1 2.31\n1,630 ..................................- 1 4 .7 2 13.01 1 2 .4 7\n1,660 ..................................... 1 4 .8 2 1 3 .1 0 1 2 .5 6\n1,700 ..................................- 1 5 .0 3 1 3 .2 7 1 2 .7 2\n1,730 ..................................- 1 5 .2 3 1 3 .4 4 1 2 .8 6\n1,760 ......................— — 1 5.34 1 3 .5 3 1 2 .9 4\n1 ,800.........................- 1 5 .5 4 1 3 .7 0 1 3 .0 8\n1,830 .................................. 1 5 .7 2 1 3 .8 6 1 3 .2 5\n1,860 ___________________ . 1 5.80 1 3 .9 5 1 3.33\n1 ,900..................................... 1 5 .9 7 14.11 1 3 .4 9\n1,930 ..................................... 1 6 .1 6 1 4 .2 9 1 3 .6 6\n1,960 ................„ ....